  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cooperative Development Program (CDP) - Land O&apos;Lakes International Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the CDP APS mechanism and in support of locally-led development, E3/LS will provide funding to Land O&apos;Lakes International to implement cooperative development activities in Rwanda and Malawi. Specifically, Land O&apos;Lakes International will improve cooperative enabling environments through building the capacity of apex associations and advance cooperative business performance of primary and tertiary cooperatives. Additionally, Land O&apos;Lakes will conduct research on locally-led cooperative development and alignment with women and youth engagement. These field-based activities build the capacity of local, democratic institutions and advance the Agency&apos;s objectives of local resource mobilization and self-reliance.</narrative>
  </description>
